WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 14]

01:53.259 --> 01:56.180
You want to stop me from being born.

01:57.289 --> 01:58.580
No one of you can stop me!

01:59.580 --> 02:01.340
Oh no.

02:01.340 --> 02:02.530
Something bad will happen.

02:07.620 --> 02:09.220
Can't I stop you either?

02:09.740 --> 02:10.419
Look!

02:10.780 --> 02:11.140
This is...

02:11.220 --> 02:11.700
Who is that?

02:11.860 --> 02:12.780
Lord Wuxiang.

02:12.900 --> 02:14.090
It is Lord Wuxiang.

02:28.810 --> 02:30.060
Ge is out.

02:51.340 --> 02:52.860
Look, it has been suppressed.

02:53.170 --> 02:54.140
Amazing.

02:55.300 --> 02:56.260
As expected of Immortal.

02:56.260 --> 02:57.100
Yes.

02:57.300 --> 02:58.300
Great!

02:59.340 --> 03:00.530
Great.

03:01.940 --> 03:03.580
We're saved.

03:23.340 --> 03:25.060
This is the magic instrument that only Immortals can possess,

03:25.500 --> 03:26.140
Moon bell.

03:26.620 --> 03:27.900
Ge has become Immortal.

03:32.940 --> 03:33.500
Ge,

03:34.060 --> 03:34.980
congratulations on your out.

03:35.540 --> 03:36.500
After a thousand years,

03:36.740 --> 03:37.500
Immortal Palace

03:37.620 --> 03:39.300
finally has an immortal.

03:39.900 --> 03:41.290
It's happiness to Immortal Palace

03:41.820 --> 03:43.260
and a blessing to the Three Realms.

03:44.500 --> 03:45.260
How did this disaster

03:46.460 --> 03:47.370
happen today?

04:03.580 --> 04:04.380
Fix the Protection Spell,

04:04.810 --> 04:05.450
reinforce the formation,

04:06.090 --> 04:07.060
check the casualties,

04:08.260 --> 04:09.380
and find out who she is.

04:35.780 --> 04:36.940
What's going on?

04:37.020 --> 04:38.140
What happened?

04:38.300 --> 04:39.580
How did this happen?

04:39.740 --> 04:40.860
Why is it getting dark?

04:41.500 --> 04:41.980
Look.

04:42.210 --> 04:43.100
Look!

04:43.100 --> 04:44.220
Yes.

04:44.300 --> 04:44.940
Look.

04:45.140 --> 04:47.900
The deeper the color of the glazed fruit gets,

04:47.900 --> 04:51.420
the fewer restrictions Immortal Palace has on us.

04:52.820 --> 04:55.020
It looks like the cracks of Four Seasons Monument

04:55.540 --> 04:57.100
will be deepened.

04:57.380 --> 04:57.940
I heard that

04:58.180 --> 04:59.340
it was a human boy.

04:59.940 --> 05:00.900
He killed Ao Hen

05:01.180 --> 05:02.140
with the Moon Sword.

05:03.580 --> 05:06.260
But he can't save his own life

05:17.700 --> 05:18.380
I play to celebrate that in this life, I could meet

05:19.580 --> 05:20.860
a man who used Moon Sword

05:21.730 --> 05:22.900
with a mortal body.

05:29.460 --> 05:29.940
Lu Li,

05:31.460 --> 05:32.140
you are the only one

05:33.860 --> 05:35.060
who is worthy to appreciate this song.

06:00.780 --> 06:02.050
-It is Lord Wuxiang. -Lord Wuxiang.

06:02.490 --> 06:03.330
Lord Wuxiang is out.

06:03.330 --> 06:04.860
Yes, Lord Wuxiang has come out.

06:05.210 --> 06:05.850
Great.

06:06.340 --> 06:07.620
The Immortal Palace finally has an Immortal.

06:07.620 --> 06:08.020
Yes.

06:08.020 --> 06:09.420
-Lord Wuxiang is finally out. -Great.

06:10.340 --> 06:11.020
Great.

06:11.300 --> 06:11.730
Brother...

06:12.940 --> 06:13.380
Brother!

06:16.020 --> 06:16.580
Brother!

06:17.900 --> 06:18.420
Brother!

06:21.060 --> 06:21.700
Brother!

06:26.260 --> 06:27.380
Clean your heart.

06:33.740 --> 06:34.540
Ge,

06:34.980 --> 06:36.180
you came back after experiencing hardships.

06:36.380 --> 06:38.540
There shouldn't be any trace of the mortal world.

06:38.780 --> 06:40.930
Why are you so distracted?

06:42.940 --> 06:43.940
I experienced hardships with my heart.

06:44.490 --> 06:45.860
It's inevitable to be affected.

06:46.610 --> 06:47.980
I will clean it myself

06:48.420 --> 06:50.260
and return to the deity whose heart is

06:50.980 --> 06:52.380
without anger or worries.

06:55.340 --> 06:55.780
Ge,

06:56.380 --> 06:57.500
you've been cultivating for a thousand years,

06:57.500 --> 06:58.500
and you have always been self-disciplined.

06:59.100 --> 06:59.740
I

07:00.140 --> 07:01.140
rest assured.

07:01.380 --> 07:01.930
Brother.

07:03.660 --> 07:04.050
Brother,

07:04.250 --> 07:05.090
you're back.

07:09.820 --> 07:10.330
Immortal,

07:11.420 --> 07:13.180
disciples are waiting in the Litian Temple.

07:24.980 --> 07:27.460
[Immortal Palace, Litian Temple]

07:25.500 --> 07:27.300
When we were busy fixing Four Seasons Monument,

07:27.620 --> 07:29.460
Ao Hen managed to break the Ziji Shield

07:29.540 --> 07:30.620
and led the demons to come out.

07:31.180 --> 07:32.100
I think

07:32.500 --> 07:33.620
this must have something to do with

07:34.060 --> 07:35.220
Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

07:36.260 --> 07:37.460
And the one who played Bone-Corroding Harp

07:37.820 --> 07:39.220
is a disciple in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

07:39.580 --> 07:40.180
Liu Shao.

07:41.580 --> 07:43.780
Did you really play Bone-Corroding Harp?

07:49.620 --> 07:49.980
Liu Shao,

07:50.980 --> 07:51.620
the Immortal is asking you.

07:53.620 --> 07:54.580
Lu Li and I

07:56.420 --> 07:57.460
got Bone-Corroding Harp back

07:59.420 --> 08:00.500
together.

08:02.220 --> 08:02.980
When the string was broken,

08:04.580 --> 08:05.580
we fixed it together.

08:15.260 --> 08:16.940
This is a spirit vein only a high-level demon has.

08:17.460 --> 08:18.780
It can only be extracted in extreme pain.

08:19.380 --> 08:20.530
If the demon doesn't have an ulterior motive,

08:21.300 --> 08:22.540
why would he take such a risk?

08:27.100 --> 08:27.650
So,

08:28.660 --> 08:29.660
who gave it to you?

08:30.810 --> 08:31.740
It's a spirit vein.

08:32.860 --> 08:33.700
Isn't it hair?

08:34.340 --> 08:35.780
The Zeshui Hair from ten thousand years ago

08:36.500 --> 08:37.530
was found by you.

08:39.299 --> 08:40.020
It was not easy.

08:41.980 --> 08:43.500
Could it be that He Na took his spirit vein out

08:44.100 --> 08:45.460
to save me?

08:45.940 --> 08:46.660
Look at her.

08:47.380 --> 08:48.890
Her words don't match.

08:49.090 --> 08:50.700
She is out of her mind.

08:50.820 --> 08:51.410
Liu Shao.

08:54.260 --> 08:55.060
When I got it,

08:56.580 --> 08:58.180
it was just said to be a single hair.

09:01.500 --> 09:03.700
You're so eloquent and full of excuses.

09:04.700 --> 09:06.580
How dare you say you are not the spy?

09:07.700 --> 09:09.140
Liu Shao was hunted by Ao Hen before

09:09.260 --> 09:10.060
and had nowhere to hide.

09:10.300 --> 09:11.340
How could she be a spy?

09:11.500 --> 09:12.580
Don't frame her.

09:12.780 --> 09:13.660
That's right.

09:13.780 --> 09:14.980
Is the Immortal Palace still unreasonable?

09:17.580 --> 09:18.420
Fatty, Xue.

09:19.100 --> 09:19.620
I think

09:19.900 --> 09:20.860
you disciples

09:21.380 --> 09:22.930
have been taught badly.

09:23.820 --> 09:24.940
You think that the Immortal Palace

09:25.540 --> 09:26.860
should be indebted to you and owe you

09:27.020 --> 09:28.380
just because a few people died.

09:30.220 --> 09:30.620
Immortal,

09:31.060 --> 09:32.340
why don't we inform the Three Realms that

09:32.740 --> 09:34.740
this disaster was caused by the rebellion of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

09:35.180 --> 09:36.940
forbid people from mourning for Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

09:37.300 --> 09:38.580
and forbid them from accepting people's worship

09:39.260 --> 09:40.180
to show immortal power?

09:41.780 --> 09:42.420
Yes.

09:42.580 --> 09:43.940
Aren't our lives lives?

09:44.220 --> 09:45.020
-Yes. -Yes.

09:45.100 --> 09:46.340
Aren't our lives lives?

09:49.460 --> 09:50.780
How can you do that?

09:54.300 --> 09:55.620
What did they do wrong?

09:57.380 --> 09:58.340
Under Four Seasons Monument,

09:59.140 --> 10:00.300
Lord sacrificed himself.

10:01.170 --> 10:02.300
Many seniors died.

10:03.620 --> 10:05.180
They risked their lives to fight against demons.

10:05.770 --> 10:07.020
What did they do wrong?

10:07.380 --> 10:07.980
How dare you!

10:08.340 --> 10:08.860
What?

10:09.540 --> 10:11.740
Did I say anything wrong?

10:14.410 --> 10:15.540
All of us,

10:15.980 --> 10:17.180
from the first day we came to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

10:17.770 --> 10:18.540
we were taught

10:18.860 --> 10:20.060
to suppress demons and protect all living beings.

10:21.530 --> 10:22.740
Just because of Immortal Palace's

10:22.740 --> 10:23.780
suspect for no reason,

10:24.260 --> 10:25.660
do you want to ruin our lives?

10:26.620 --> 10:27.580
Then what is the difference

10:28.890 --> 10:29.900
between you and those demons

10:30.540 --> 10:31.660
who kill everyone

10:32.180 --> 10:33.180
who gets in their way?

10:35.940 --> 10:37.260
You dominate our lives

10:38.340 --> 10:39.220
not because of right and wrong,

10:41.540 --> 10:42.660
but for pros and cons.

10:43.770 --> 10:44.350
You

10:46.060 --> 10:47.540
are not worthy to be called the leaders of the Three Realms.

10:48.260 --> 10:49.340
You insulted Immortal Palace!

10:50.060 --> 10:50.820
Do you want to die?

11:09.100 --> 11:09.650
Moon Sword...

11:11.740 --> 11:12.900
Why do you have it?

11:13.700 --> 11:14.820
Phoenixes choose sycamore trees to rest,

11:15.330 --> 11:16.260
while good swords choose their owners.

11:17.300 --> 11:18.660
Why can't I have it?

11:19.740 --> 11:20.500
Lu Li has died.

11:21.300 --> 11:22.860
Even the Moon Sword has a different master.

11:23.460 --> 11:23.900
Immortal,

11:24.300 --> 11:25.500
this woman is too unreasonable.

11:26.100 --> 11:27.220
She must be taught a lesson.

11:29.380 --> 11:31.900
Since you insist that Marquis Wu Yang's Mansion has done nothing wrong,

11:33.740 --> 11:34.380
I can

11:35.700 --> 11:37.460
give you a chance.

11:44.030 --> 11:46.720
[Bone Melting Pool]

11:51.860 --> 11:52.360
Come on.

11:52.500 --> 11:53.030
Go inside.

11:54.060 --> 11:55.860
There is a Bone Melting Pool in Immortal Palace.

11:57.220 --> 11:59.220
It's surrounded by thorns that are ten thousand years old.

11:59.900 --> 12:01.380
There are countless evil auras inside.

12:02.540 --> 12:04.220
If the demons and villains are trapped inside,

12:04.940 --> 12:06.660
they will die.

12:08.340 --> 12:10.460
But if someone has upright and pure thoughts,

12:11.260 --> 12:12.460
he can go in and out safely.

12:13.980 --> 12:16.260
Are you willing to use your life to prove your innocence?

12:17.340 --> 12:18.060
In order to save my fellow disciples who are alive

12:18.100 --> 12:19.420
from being ruined by you,

12:20.450 --> 12:21.090
I want to go.

13:14.980 --> 13:16.060
Come at me if you dare.

13:16.060 --> 13:17.220
Don't hurt my family.

13:17.820 --> 13:18.820
Young lady,

13:19.340 --> 13:21.100
you are quite bold.

13:21.540 --> 13:22.780
Aren't you afraid of me?

13:23.260 --> 13:24.380
I'm not afraid of you.

13:24.980 --> 13:26.100
You can't kill me.

13:28.530 --> 13:30.620
I'm waiting for you to learn hard...

13:30.620 --> 13:32.180
I'll definitely achieve something

13:32.530 --> 13:33.900
and won't need to be afraid of Ao Hen.

13:34.240 --> 13:36.460
[Imperial Cosmos Hall]

13:39.860 --> 13:40.730
Miss Xi,

13:40.730 --> 13:41.700
it's all my fault.

13:41.700 --> 13:42.300
Don't blame Liu Shao.

13:42.300 --> 13:43.220
It has nothing to do with Liu Shao.

13:43.220 --> 13:44.460
Xue, don't be like this.

13:46.260 --> 13:47.540
You don't understand kindness.

13:48.180 --> 13:49.260
You are different from us.

13:49.940 --> 13:51.180
You don't have the right to scold her.

13:52.140 --> 13:53.220
Everything she got

13:53.900 --> 13:56.020
was earned

13:56.460 --> 13:57.580
through her hard work.

14:02.420 --> 14:03.420
It seems

14:03.980 --> 14:05.620
what this woman does and thinks

14:06.570 --> 14:07.980
is pure and upright.

14:08.940 --> 14:11.140
Why would she destroy Four Seasons Monument?

14:20.210 --> 14:21.020
This is...

14:40.700 --> 14:42.420
It's not valid

14:43.260 --> 14:43.900
to stop the trial with the help of other things.

14:53.460 --> 14:54.260
Bracelets...

14:55.220 --> 14:56.100
Lu Li...

15:00.060 --> 15:00.540
No!

15:01.420 --> 15:03.090
No. Lu Li gave it to me.

15:12.920 --> 15:16.030
♫On rainy days, the wind blows smoke♫

15:14.820 --> 15:15.780
Give it back to me.

15:16.030 --> 15:18.120
♫Into circles♫

15:17.100 --> 15:19.340
Why did it turn into this?

15:19.250 --> 15:22.100
♫On both sides, I’m chanting♫

15:22.400 --> 15:24.200
♫The night is sleepless♫

15:25.510 --> 15:28.520
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

15:28.660 --> 15:30.830
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

15:29.770 --> 15:30.900
I was born with only half a heart

15:31.280 --> 15:36.650
♫Your promise, my fate♫

15:31.620 --> 15:32.460
Now

15:33.180 --> 15:34.260
I have found the other half.

15:36.780 --> 15:37.300
It is you.

15:38.230 --> 15:41.440
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

15:40.980 --> 15:42.420
Lu Li is dead.

15:41.450 --> 15:43.500
♫But my heart is still the same♫

15:43.420 --> 15:44.860
This is the only thing he left for me.

15:44.580 --> 15:47.660
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

15:46.170 --> 15:47.780
Are you going to take it away from me too?

15:47.660 --> 15:49.220
♫Is like the things we went through♫

15:49.300 --> 15:49.980
Liu Shao?

15:50.870 --> 15:53.560
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

15:51.980 --> 15:53.620
The moon is above the willow branch.

15:53.940 --> 15:55.880
♫The moment we passed each other♫

15:54.620 --> 15:55.500
What a good name!

15:56.140 --> 15:56.740
You're 18 this year.

15:56.560 --> 16:02.280
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

15:56.740 --> 15:57.340
I'm 23.

15:58.020 --> 15:58.700
What should you call me?

15:59.180 --> 16:02.460
Brother Lu Li.

16:02.500 --> 16:03.300
Good girl.

16:02.660 --> 16:07.980
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

16:04.380 --> 16:06.380
If you want to make a living in Marquis Wuyang's mansion,

16:06.380 --> 16:07.810
you have to listen to me.

16:08.940 --> 16:14.990
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

16:10.940 --> 16:11.860
Give it back to me.

16:12.620 --> 16:14.530
Lu Li gave it to me.

16:15.390 --> 16:21.610
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

16:17.140 --> 16:17.540
Look,

16:18.340 --> 16:19.370
I'm in your hands now.

16:20.420 --> 16:21.220
I won't let anything happen to you.

16:21.610 --> 16:27.820
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

16:22.060 --> 16:22.940
I will protect you.

16:23.500 --> 16:24.260
Do you understand?

16:27.820 --> 16:33.340
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

16:34.190 --> 16:40.160
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

16:34.220 --> 16:35.700
But my life is long.

16:35.900 --> 16:37.010
What if I can't afford to hire you?

16:37.650 --> 16:38.780
I'll sell myself to you.

16:39.380 --> 16:40.140
A coin.

16:40.540 --> 16:41.700
Lu Li is sold to Liu Shao.

16:40.550 --> 16:46.560
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

16:42.460 --> 16:43.300
Will you never regret it?

16:44.260 --> 16:45.210
Never.

16:46.700 --> 16:47.420
I like you.

16:46.850 --> 16:53.280
♫If you see me for the first time in this life, I'll forever hold it in my heart♫

16:47.500 --> 16:49.100
I just want to be an ordinary person

16:49.660 --> 16:51.500
and live a happy life with you.

16:51.820 --> 16:53.700
OK, let's be a normal couple

16:53.910 --> 16:56.810
♫Get lost in your sky♫

16:54.620 --> 16:55.980
and live an ordinary and happy life

16:57.030 --> 16:59.620
♫Whose wilderness♫

16:57.580 --> 16:58.060
I go

16:59.380 --> 17:00.060
wherever you go.

17:00.230 --> 17:05.010
♫Clouds billow up and fade away in the four seas♫

17:01.060 --> 17:01.620
Lu Li,

17:03.020 --> 17:04.140
after we pull out the Moon Sword

17:04.420 --> 17:05.460
and defeat Ao Hen,

17:06.630 --> 17:09.670
♫The mountains and rivers after the farewell♫

17:06.700 --> 17:08.900
remember to ask your master to come to my home to propose to me

17:09.670 --> 17:11.940
♫Silence♫

17:11.940 --> 17:14.410
♫Time sighs silently♫

17:13.339 --> 17:13.940
Liu Shao.

17:14.410 --> 17:19.300
♫Whose passing years♫

17:15.500 --> 17:16.140
Then I...

17:16.579 --> 17:17.780
will ask Lord to be the matchmaker

17:17.940 --> 17:18.859
to propose marriage to you when I am back.

17:21.099 --> 17:22.740
Lu Li!

17:25.700 --> 17:26.810
Maybe this year

17:27.380 --> 17:29.180
we can also choose a good day to get married.

17:40.050 --> 17:41.020
But I will die.

17:42.500 --> 17:43.060
I'll accompany you.

17:43.700 --> 17:44.940
I'm really going to die.

17:46.100 --> 17:47.020
I'll really be with you.

17:48.860 --> 17:49.900
Even if I die,

17:51.810 --> 17:53.140
I won't let you die.

18:03.860 --> 18:04.500
This...

18:06.900 --> 18:08.740
Why do I feel so familiar?

18:16.380 --> 18:17.620
Wasn't that Lu Li?

18:18.260 --> 18:18.940
Why did I...

18:25.700 --> 18:26.460
Bracelet...

18:43.660 --> 18:44.060
Bracelet...

18:45.060 --> 18:46.340
I have found the bracelet.

18:48.380 --> 18:49.500
I only have you,

18:50.540 --> 18:51.580
only have you...

18:51.580 --> 18:52.860
Not only did she walk out of the Bone Melting Pool,

18:53.540 --> 18:54.620
she even went through the Life Gate

18:54.620 --> 18:55.860
and directly came to Four Seasons Monument.

18:56.060 --> 18:57.340
The Life Path of Bone Melting Pool was originally

18:57.340 --> 18:58.860
connected to Four Seasons Monument.

18:59.300 --> 19:00.780
But how did she do it?

19:03.900 --> 19:04.380
Look!

20:07.180 --> 20:08.100
How is this possible?

20:10.660 --> 20:11.260
Lu Li,

20:12.420 --> 20:13.210
is it you?

20:14.100 --> 20:14.900
How dare a human

20:15.090 --> 20:16.060
offend Immortal?

20:17.410 --> 20:17.940
Lu Li...

20:36.900 --> 20:37.380
Immortal,

20:38.260 --> 20:39.050
why does your face...

20:39.980 --> 20:41.340
You look exactly like that mortal.

20:42.700 --> 20:44.260
No matter if I have an appearanc, I am still me.

20:44.620 --> 20:45.570
What are your doubts?

20:47.580 --> 20:49.060
When Ge was promoted to Immortal,

20:49.340 --> 20:50.020
he received mortal things,

20:50.220 --> 20:51.540
so he looks like a mortal.

20:51.780 --> 20:53.020
This is a good omen.

20:57.260 --> 20:57.940
Go back first.

20:58.980 --> 21:00.100
I have something to discuss with Immortal Master.

21:01.740 --> 21:02.220
Yes.

21:11.180 --> 21:12.700
Four Seasons Monument is made by the God of the Sun.

21:14.500 --> 21:15.810
Her blood can stabilize Four Seasons Monument.

21:17.660 --> 21:18.580
It only means...

21:35.570 --> 21:35.980
Ge,

21:36.700 --> 21:38.460
do you suspect Liu Shao is...

21:39.700 --> 21:40.060
Yes.

21:41.450 --> 21:43.060
Sun Spirit is in her body.

21:44.810 --> 21:46.060
If that's the case,

21:46.460 --> 21:48.170
I really underestimated her.

21:48.460 --> 21:50.340
I thought she only had the fragment of the spirit.

21:50.500 --> 21:52.660
I didn't expect that she would be the heir to Sun Spirit.

21:53.860 --> 21:55.220
She can walk out of the Bone Melting Pool.

21:56.540 --> 21:57.850
It shows that she is upright.

21:59.380 --> 22:00.220
There must be another reason

22:00.980 --> 22:01.820
for Bone-Corroding Harp.

22:05.380 --> 22:05.860
Lu Li.

22:09.140 --> 22:09.620
Lu Li,

22:11.290 --> 22:12.380
you're Lu Li, right?

22:13.740 --> 22:15.180
You have Sun Spirit in your body.

22:16.060 --> 22:16.900
Stay in Xiyin Mountain,

22:17.700 --> 22:18.380
and don't go back to the mortal world.

22:18.980 --> 22:20.140
I won't.

22:20.540 --> 22:22.140
I'll go wherever you go.

22:28.580 --> 22:29.940
I am the Immortal of Xihui Mountain,

22:31.700 --> 22:32.290
Luo Ge.

22:34.700 --> 22:35.140
No,

22:35.940 --> 22:36.580
you're Lu Li.

22:37.140 --> 22:37.900
You're Lu Li.

22:38.260 --> 22:38.780
Lu Li!

22:39.540 --> 22:40.580
You are Lu Li.

22:43.620 --> 22:44.940
Love is a sin.

22:46.300 --> 22:47.500
Why are you doing this?

23:00.980 --> 23:01.460
Liu Shao,

23:03.060 --> 23:04.420
are you really not going back with us?

23:05.820 --> 23:06.180
No.

23:07.140 --> 23:07.860
There are some things

23:09.340 --> 23:10.180
I must figure out.

23:11.340 --> 23:11.700
Sister-in-law,

23:12.860 --> 23:14.540
do you really think that cold Immortal

23:15.460 --> 23:16.660
has anything to do with my boss?

23:18.380 --> 23:18.860
Impossible.

23:19.940 --> 23:20.540
If they are related,

23:20.850 --> 23:22.260
how could he let you get into Bone Melting Pool?

23:22.700 --> 23:23.100
That's right.

23:23.980 --> 23:24.860
Look at your injury.

23:26.340 --> 23:28.410
But after the Moon Sword left Lu Li,

23:28.810 --> 23:30.460
it immediately took Luo Ge as his master

23:30.820 --> 23:31.620
and got controlled by him.

23:31.980 --> 23:32.380
Well,

23:33.020 --> 23:35.180
that only means Moon Sword

23:36.100 --> 23:37.100
is not a good thing.

23:37.700 --> 23:38.300
Exactly.

23:39.260 --> 23:40.340
It hurt you badly

23:40.810 --> 23:41.700
and killed Lu Li.

23:42.180 --> 23:43.660
I don't think it treats you as its owners.

23:44.980 --> 23:46.780
It took Luo Ge as its owner obediently

23:47.380 --> 23:48.540
just because Luo Ge is too powerful,

23:49.020 --> 23:50.020
But Immortal Luo Ge

23:50.380 --> 23:51.420
came out

23:51.820 --> 23:52.540
just after Lu Li died.

23:53.260 --> 23:53.700
Besides,

23:53.980 --> 23:55.290
he has the same face as Lu Li.

23:56.660 --> 23:57.660
How could a mortal Lu Li

23:58.500 --> 23:59.930
affect Immortal?

24:03.690 --> 24:04.220
So,

24:04.620 --> 24:05.660
I must investigate it.

24:07.020 --> 24:07.340
What if...

24:10.060 --> 24:10.500
What if...

24:11.540 --> 24:12.460
Lu Li is still alive?

24:13.780 --> 24:14.300
Liu Shao,

24:14.980 --> 24:16.060
we've already seen it.

24:17.460 --> 24:17.740
No.

24:18.900 --> 24:20.420
I've been taught a lesson before.

24:21.380 --> 24:22.660
What I see may not be true.

24:23.450 --> 24:24.420
I'm not going back.

24:29.620 --> 24:30.170
Fattie,

24:30.740 --> 24:31.860
I'll leave Xue to you.

24:32.050 --> 24:32.460
Remember,

24:33.660 --> 24:35.010
you must work hard when you go back.

24:36.260 --> 24:37.980
Don't let the people in the Three Realms look down on us.

24:47.700 --> 24:48.700
Of course.

24:51.940 --> 24:52.980
Brothers and sisters,

24:53.420 --> 24:53.940
let's go back.

24:54.700 --> 24:55.460
Lord has died.

24:56.220 --> 24:56.860
The human world

24:57.290 --> 24:59.140
has to rely on us.

25:00.900 --> 25:01.340
Sister-in-law,

25:02.100 --> 25:02.700
take care.

25:03.300 --> 25:04.260
Senior Liu Shao, take care.

25:04.260 --> 25:05.020
Take care.

25:05.420 --> 25:06.300
We're leaving.

25:15.500 --> 25:16.300
How can Immortal Luo Ge

25:16.810 --> 25:18.340
have the same face as Lu Li?

25:20.940 --> 25:22.060
Is he really alive?

25:28.740 --> 25:29.980
That is where the three palaces are.

25:31.220 --> 25:32.460
This is Xiyin Mountain.

25:34.580 --> 25:35.300
Leader Zhuo,

25:35.780 --> 25:36.420
this place is

25:36.420 --> 25:37.700
more elegant than other places.

25:38.860 --> 25:40.220
This is Immortal Luo Ge's sister,

25:40.860 --> 25:41.660
Luo Ning's residence.

25:42.580 --> 25:43.500
In the Immortal Palace,

25:43.900 --> 25:45.660
only her room is by the water.

25:47.420 --> 25:49.540
Is this the person who played Bone-Corroding Harp?

25:50.020 --> 25:51.300
I want to hear

25:51.490 --> 25:53.540
what's special about her playing.

25:54.780 --> 25:55.460
Zhuo,

25:56.020 --> 25:57.500
don't get involved in this.

25:58.260 --> 25:59.420
Otherwise,

25:59.820 --> 26:02.140
I will remove the beads on the golden crown

26:03.740 --> 26:05.900
of Leader Shang

26:06.140 --> 26:07.220
and play with them.

26:10.980 --> 26:11.660
This round is difficult

26:11.980 --> 26:12.900
for you.

26:13.900 --> 26:14.660
Take care.

26:40.740 --> 26:41.620
That day,

26:41.740 --> 26:43.300
you played the harp, right?

26:44.780 --> 26:46.060
Play it again, and

26:46.180 --> 26:47.260
let me listen to it.

26:51.060 --> 26:52.100
Brahma Song?

26:53.140 --> 26:54.340
But Bone-Corroding Harp

26:54.340 --> 26:55.500
was taken away by the Immortal Palace.

26:56.410 --> 26:57.580
How can I play it?

27:26.020 --> 27:26.860
Wind chimes?

28:12.500 --> 28:13.220
Where did you

28:13.380 --> 28:14.100
learn this song?

28:15.300 --> 28:16.300
I didn't learn it on purpose.

28:17.140 --> 28:17.860
I just

28:18.100 --> 28:19.060
saw

28:19.410 --> 28:20.380
an old tree blooming.

28:21.180 --> 28:21.900
Then, I suddenly got it.

28:23.980 --> 28:24.980
I feel that

28:25.460 --> 28:27.060
it's a song created before.

28:28.450 --> 28:29.980
It sounds very familiar,

28:30.780 --> 28:31.710
and it's especially nice.

28:34.940 --> 28:35.540
I didn't expect that

28:35.740 --> 28:36.780
you would be not only beautiful,

28:37.180 --> 28:38.090
but also intelligent.

28:39.780 --> 28:40.140
I dare not.

28:40.700 --> 28:41.450
My name is Liu Shao.

28:42.220 --> 28:43.570
You must be

28:43.820 --> 28:44.740
the legendary Fairy Luo Ning, right?

28:46.860 --> 28:48.300
If anyone bullies you,

28:48.780 --> 28:50.020
just tell them my name.

28:54.140 --> 28:55.180
Why are you injured?

28:56.140 --> 28:56.500
Let's go.

28:56.810 --> 28:57.420
Come in with me.

28:57.900 --> 28:58.940
Let me put on

28:59.020 --> 29:00.570
the new healing dew I made for you.

29:00.980 --> 29:02.460
I promise you'll be fine.

29:02.740 --> 29:03.340
After that,

29:03.460 --> 29:04.980
I'll show you around, okay?

29:07.300 --> 29:07.730
Let's go.

29:33.900 --> 29:35.020
When I was blocked during my promotion,

29:36.060 --> 29:37.260
I had to seal myself here

29:38.460 --> 29:39.540
and cut out half of my heart

29:40.020 --> 29:41.380
and send it to the mortal world to experience hardships.

29:42.260 --> 29:43.780
Is it because

29:44.260 --> 29:45.580
my half heart had a mortal body

29:46.140 --> 29:47.450
that I have this face?

29:50.810 --> 29:52.620
Since you've come back from hardships,

29:52.940 --> 29:55.060
why bother about the shadow in the human world?

29:55.620 --> 29:57.340
What happened on the way

29:57.340 --> 29:58.740
is not important.

29:58.740 --> 30:00.700
The result is your practice.

30:02.100 --> 30:03.060
But Liu Shao

30:03.300 --> 30:04.860
is the obstacle on your way to becoming a deity.

30:05.660 --> 30:07.140
You must not let her stay by your side.

30:10.140 --> 30:11.980
Are you afraid that the history of ten thousand years ago would repeat itself?

30:12.660 --> 30:13.580
Or do you also think that

30:14.780 --> 30:15.900
Luo Ge will be bewitched by beauty?

30:16.380 --> 30:17.660
But what in her body

30:17.980 --> 30:19.170
is the power of God of the Sun.

30:19.540 --> 30:21.020
How can I not worry?

30:22.020 --> 30:23.700
That's why I let her stay.

30:24.660 --> 30:26.180
Her blood has the power of the God of the Sun.

30:27.060 --> 30:28.740
It can help us stabilize Four Seasons Monument.

30:30.150 --> 30:33.690
♫I ask the cloud and the flower♫

30:34.090 --> 30:37.660
♫How I can stop missing you♫

30:40.390 --> 30:43.930
♫I walk through the time♫

30:41.740 --> 30:42.460
Isn't it beautiful?

30:44.290 --> 30:48.300
♫Whether we can forever♫

30:50.130 --> 30:54.890
♫Love each other like now and carve this between our eyebrows♫

30:51.060 --> 30:52.570
What did they do to you?

30:52.780 --> 30:53.660
There are so many wounds.

30:54.890 --> 30:59.420
♫A white horse came and became a poem♫

30:55.380 --> 30:56.780
It has been bald for years.

30:57.940 --> 30:58.580
Look,

30:58.740 --> 31:00.060
the flowers bloom as soon as you come.

30:59.340 --> 31:01.900
[Immortal Palace, Feiyuan House]

31:00.310 --> 31:05.140
♫Memory is beautiful and I am still loving you♫

31:05.140 --> 31:09.260
♫In the vast blue sky, I prefer to pursue the moon♫

31:07.270 --> 31:10.470
[Immortal Palace, Xiyin Mountain]

31:09.260 --> 31:11.660
♫Do you know it?♫

31:11.660 --> 31:17.250
♫Thousands of lights made it like a day♫

31:17.470 --> 31:21.340
♫It is like my heart where you are still there♫

31:21.340 --> 31:27.460
♫I am waiting. The moon is above the willow branch♫

31:22.380 --> 31:23.740
Did Xiyin Mountain change its gardener?

31:26.260 --> 31:28.180
These withered trees bloom again.

31:27.690 --> 31:31.480
♫I only want to hold your hands and count beans of love♫

31:31.480 --> 31:37.670
♫I am guarding you. A turning around♫

31:37.940 --> 31:41.730
♫Exchanges staying together forever♫

31:41.730 --> 31:49.980
♫The love is as before♫

31:48.540 --> 31:49.730
I was curious

31:50.060 --> 31:51.260
so I asked Immortal Master about you.

31:52.140 --> 31:52.980
I think you need

31:53.140 --> 31:53.820
this gift.

31:54.980 --> 31:55.860
What is this?

31:56.500 --> 31:57.140
This

31:57.290 --> 31:58.620
is the new fragrance I developed.

31:59.380 --> 32:00.140
Take it out

32:00.500 --> 32:01.820
and drop a drop on your wrist.

32:02.500 --> 32:03.220
Smell it, and

32:03.700 --> 32:05.820
you can have a sweet dream.

32:06.820 --> 32:07.740
In your dream,

32:08.010 --> 32:10.020
you can meet the person you like

32:10.660 --> 32:11.820
You can also tell him that

32:12.410 --> 32:13.580
you miss him,

32:14.820 --> 32:15.740
or

32:16.260 --> 32:17.140
you are doing well.

32:19.460 --> 32:21.220
Am I doing well?

32:47.580 --> 32:48.220
Master,

32:49.060 --> 32:49.660
I

32:49.860 --> 32:51.860
bought you good medicine.

32:52.580 --> 32:54.540
It will definitely cure your cough.

33:17.220 --> 33:19.300
You are acting like a woman.

33:22.460 --> 33:23.180
Fu,

33:23.620 --> 33:25.100
if you dare to offend me again,

33:25.300 --> 33:27.180
I'll destroy your demon power of a thousand years.

33:28.180 --> 33:29.620
Luo Ge has gone through hardships and become immortal.

33:31.100 --> 33:33.090
He is investigating the spy in Lusitai.

33:35.980 --> 33:37.220
I have investigated the audience

33:37.220 --> 33:37.980
on that day.

33:38.900 --> 33:40.220
including the disciples in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

33:41.340 --> 33:41.900
That day,

33:42.420 --> 33:44.140
Liu Shao was about to finish mending Four Seasons Monument.

33:44.450 --> 33:45.260
But unexpectedly,

33:45.540 --> 33:46.620
she flipped the harp

33:47.020 --> 33:48.210
and played another tune for no reason

33:48.210 --> 33:49.180
and hit Four Seasons Monument.

33:51.100 --> 33:53.100
The melody I played

33:53.900 --> 33:55.660
can attack and destroy things.

33:56.210 --> 33:57.420
As soon as I play it,

33:57.740 --> 33:58.820
clouds will be pierced and stones will be broken.

33:59.420 --> 34:00.700
Since Liu Shao is going to damage Four Seasons Monument,

34:01.620 --> 34:02.860
why did she repair it before?

34:05.340 --> 34:06.220
It doesn't make sense.

34:07.420 --> 34:10.100
I developed so many cracks with the sound of my musical instrument.

34:11.580 --> 34:13.060
With just one strike of Moon Sword,

34:13.650 --> 34:15.300
Four Seasons Monument will be opened.

34:19.900 --> 34:20.780
What about Moon Sword?

34:22.260 --> 34:23.300
Who was using it?

34:33.300 --> 34:34.650
It's a disciple of Marquis Wuyang,

34:35.139 --> 34:35.929
Lu Li.

34:39.739 --> 34:40.969
Lu Li...

34:42.340 --> 34:44.420
is my body when I was experiencing hardships.

34:49.980 --> 34:50.500
Back then,

34:51.449 --> 34:53.020
in order to save Liu Shao and other people,

34:53.580 --> 34:55.420
he used Moon Sword as a mortal

34:55.980 --> 34:57.540
and was eventually devoured by the sword.

35:01.260 --> 35:02.900
But Lu Li didn't use Moon Sword

35:03.780 --> 35:04.690
to break Four Seasons Monument.

35:05.460 --> 35:07.020
Instead, he used it to kill Ao Hen.

35:12.380 --> 35:14.500
At least Lu Li has held Moon Sword.

35:15.700 --> 35:16.180
You...

35:17.700 --> 35:18.180
are not enough.

35:20.740 --> 35:21.660
Except for Lu Li,

35:22.900 --> 35:25.020
I have another disciple in Immortal Palace.

35:25.460 --> 35:27.500
She'll try to get close to Luo Ge.

35:28.850 --> 35:29.980
Lu Li is dead,

35:31.220 --> 35:32.340
but the Moon Sword is still there.

35:32.620 --> 35:33.540
It can't be counted as a failure.

35:35.100 --> 35:36.300
But for you, it's hard to say.

35:37.580 --> 35:38.500
Do you really think that

35:38.500 --> 35:40.460
Luo Ge can't find anything?

35:43.100 --> 35:44.820
Two magical weapons appeared at the same time.

35:45.620 --> 35:47.060
Ziji Shield was also broken.

35:47.780 --> 35:49.740
It should be specially designed by someone.

35:51.860 --> 35:52.700
In my opinion,

35:54.090 --> 35:54.820
Ao Hen

35:54.980 --> 35:56.660
is probably just a pawn.

35:57.450 --> 35:58.460
Liu Shao showed her magic power.

35:59.540 --> 36:01.210
Sun Spirit fragments should be scattered around here.

36:02.300 --> 36:02.890
Find them quickly.

36:04.580 --> 36:05.850
Keep an eye on Liu Shao too.

36:07.340 --> 36:07.780
Yes.

36:09.020 --> 36:11.530
There must be traces of the spell on Sun Spirit fragments.

36:12.140 --> 36:13.500
They'll know it's you once they investigate it.

36:14.420 --> 36:15.580
You're going to be exposed,

36:16.660 --> 36:18.100
but you come here

36:18.700 --> 36:20.180
and talk with me happily.

36:21.300 --> 36:22.180
About this,

36:22.340 --> 36:23.420
don't worry.

36:25.100 --> 36:26.210
My spy in the Immortal Palace

36:26.300 --> 36:27.690
will give me Sun Spirit Fragments.

36:28.820 --> 36:30.460
I have such a good spy.

36:31.100 --> 36:33.500
How can I care about Immortal Luo Ge?

36:35.890 --> 36:37.420
Instead, you need to worry about

36:37.860 --> 36:38.980
Liu Shao.

36:39.860 --> 36:41.020
You must kill her,

36:41.980 --> 36:43.620
lest she really repairs Four Seasons Monument.

36:45.860 --> 36:47.700
Your brother protects her,

36:48.700 --> 36:50.140
while you want to kill her.

36:51.540 --> 36:52.940
Since you brothers are not united,

36:53.500 --> 36:54.860
why don't you replace him?

36:55.850 --> 36:56.620
Ao Hen is dead.

36:57.180 --> 36:58.020
The Demon Realm is in chaos.

36:58.700 --> 37:01.260
This is your chance to win over the people's hearts.

37:03.060 --> 37:04.020
As for the Demon King,

37:05.260 --> 37:07.540
how can you, a half-demon, talk about it?

37:51.820 --> 37:52.370
What's wrong?

37:52.740 --> 37:54.180
Don't you like what your brother looks like now?

37:55.380 --> 37:56.260
No.

37:56.540 --> 37:57.340
I like it.

37:57.780 --> 37:58.980
I like it

37:59.260 --> 38:00.340
whatever my brother looks like.

38:01.260 --> 38:02.220
But...

38:02.500 --> 38:03.980
my brother is too pretty.

38:04.620 --> 38:06.060
I'm afraid my brother's face

38:06.250 --> 38:07.300
will cause trouble.

38:07.380 --> 38:08.420
Let me do it.

38:09.170 --> 38:10.180
I'll do it.

38:11.740 --> 38:13.420
So...

38:16.020 --> 38:17.060
Just say it.

38:18.260 --> 38:19.420
There's no need to beat about the bush

38:19.940 --> 38:20.820
between us.

38:21.540 --> 38:22.100
Brother,

38:22.300 --> 38:22.980
have some tea.

38:26.060 --> 38:26.900
I

38:27.020 --> 38:28.300
made a new friend.

38:29.500 --> 38:30.700
She is very good-looking

38:31.250 --> 38:31.860
She treats me well too.

38:33.220 --> 38:34.340
But pitifully,

38:35.820 --> 38:37.100
her life is so miserable.

38:41.780 --> 38:42.140
Brother,

38:42.860 --> 38:43.940
do you really not remember

38:44.220 --> 38:45.180
what happened to you

38:45.220 --> 38:46.100
when you were in the mortal world?

38:47.410 --> 38:48.180
Why should I remember it?

38:49.180 --> 38:50.260
But when you don't remember it,

38:50.700 --> 38:52.140
someone who was with you remembers it.

38:52.380 --> 38:53.340
What should we do?

38:54.460 --> 38:56.140
Debt in the mortal world should be solved in the mortal world.

38:57.220 --> 38:58.300
Even if there is something unfinished,

38:58.980 --> 39:00.780
for us immortals, it's nothing.

39:02.260 --> 39:02.580
Brother,

39:03.100 --> 39:04.500
we are really brothers and sisters.

39:04.650 --> 39:05.860
We have the same thought.

39:06.380 --> 39:07.020
So,

39:07.220 --> 39:08.100
I helped you

39:08.340 --> 39:10.580
trap her in her dream with fragrance.

39:11.260 --> 39:12.010
When she is there,

39:12.010 --> 39:13.300
she can be with you...

39:13.740 --> 39:14.260
no...

39:14.500 --> 39:15.420
you in the mortal world

39:15.540 --> 39:16.940
happily.

39:17.180 --> 39:18.580
She can't bother you anymore.

39:31.610 --> 39:35.410
♫How many rain seasons and rains do I need to see♫

39:35.300 --> 39:36.020
What do you think?

39:35.410 --> 39:37.990
♫Before meeting you♫

39:36.620 --> 39:37.380
Is it pretty?

39:38.180 --> 39:38.820
Yes.

39:39.740 --> 39:43.770
♫I am destined to sink to the bottom of the sea♫

39:43.770 --> 39:46.700
♫You come to my mind♫

39:47.850 --> 39:50.930
♫But this moment, you believe♫

39:50.930 --> 39:54.950
♫You are my only one. Don't hesitate♫

39:56.030 --> 39:58.910
♫Flowers fly after the rain♫

39:57.420 --> 39:59.100
Will she dream of Lu Li,

39:59.220 --> 40:02.280
♫I stay there♫

40:00.060 --> 40:02.100
half of my heart that bothers me?

40:04.250 --> 40:08.480
♫I say I miss you. Because of your name♫

40:08.650 --> 40:12.200
♫The rest of my life is all about you♫

40:12.690 --> 40:15.280
♫I can't tell if it is dream♫

40:15.650 --> 40:19.760
♫After the flower blossoms, let the love go on♫

40:20.720 --> 40:24.820
♫I say I miss you. Don't doubt it♫

40:25.010 --> 40:28.680
♫You exist in my life♫

40:29.020 --> 40:32.000
♫I want to stay with you♫

40:32.000 --> 40:38.690
♫After the spring and the winter, let the love go on♫

40:33.020 --> 40:33.900
Okay, let's go.

40:33.900 --> 40:35.500
I'll show you something fun.

40:36.890 --> 40:37.540
Follow me.

40:37.980 --> 40:38.570
What is it?

40:38.740 --> 40:39.700
Shush.

40:44.540 --> 40:45.180
Rabbit!

40:45.580 --> 40:46.770
Where did you get it?

40:47.540 --> 40:48.380
What's its name?

40:48.380 --> 40:49.940
It's our food for tonight.

40:50.380 --> 40:51.100
No way.

40:51.300 --> 40:51.940
Give it to me.

40:53.550 --> 40:57.630
♫How many rain seasons and rains do I need to see♫

40:54.140 --> 40:55.060
Just kidding.

40:55.460 --> 40:56.300
If you like it,

40:56.410 --> 40:57.500
I'll get you a load of rabbits.

40:57.630 --> 41:00.190
♫Before meeting you♫

40:58.420 --> 40:59.260
We will keep them in the mountain.

40:59.540 --> 41:00.300
Let's

41:00.820 --> 41:01.860
be a pair of rabbit kings.

41:01.610 --> 41:05.740
♫I am destined to sink to the bottom of the sea♫

41:02.100 --> 41:02.580
How is it?

41:03.740 --> 41:04.700
I'm afraid that

41:05.620 --> 41:06.980
you can't even catch one

41:05.880 --> 41:09.620
♫You come to my mind♫

41:09.960 --> 41:12.990
♫But this moment, you believe♫

41:12.990 --> 41:17.650
♫You are my only one. Don't hesitate♫

41:16.460 --> 41:17.210
Catch me!

41:17.620 --> 41:18.540
Where are you escaping?

41:17.910 --> 41:21.300
♫Flowers fly after the rain♫

41:21.300 --> 41:26.100
♫I stay there♫

41:26.320 --> 41:30.220
♫I say I miss you. Because of your name♫

41:30.620 --> 41:34.310
♫The rest of my life is all about you♫

41:34.720 --> 41:37.600
♫I can't tell if it is dream♫

41:35.500 --> 41:36.380
After I wake up from my dream,

41:37.600 --> 41:42.350
♫After the flower blossoms, let the love go on♫

41:38.140 --> 41:39.780
will I never see you again?

41:41.300 --> 41:42.100
No.

41:42.710 --> 41:47.180
♫I say I miss you. Because of your name♫

41:43.980 --> 41:44.740
Because

41:46.020 --> 41:47.340
you're also Luo Ge, right?

41:47.180 --> 41:50.410
♫The rest of my life is all about you♫

41:49.100 --> 41:50.060
Lu Li is me.

41:51.050 --> 41:53.840
♫I can't tell if it is dream♫

41:51.420 --> 41:52.340
Luo Ge is also me.

41:54.070 --> 41:58.440
♫After the flower blossoms, let the love go on♫

41:54.260 --> 41:55.260
I am with you

41:56.100 --> 41:57.020
wherever you are.

41:59.180 --> 42:03.350
♫I say I miss you. Don't doubt it♫

42:03.520 --> 42:07.150
♫You exist in my life♫

42:04.700 --> 42:06.100
This is Lu Li in the mortal world.

42:07.550 --> 42:10.500
♫I want to stay with you♫

42:10.500 --> 42:18.470
♫After the spring and the winter, let the love go on♫
